      "purpose": "`telemetry` is a vendor-neutral OpenTelemetry runtime for Go services. It owns resource identity, trace and metric providers, OTLP exporters, propagation, sampling, global registration, flush, and shutdown while returning the standard OpenTelemetry APIs.",
